<title>UK: Dresdner Kleinwort diversifies derivative business.</title>
<headline>Dresdner Kleinwort diversifies derivative business.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dresdner Kleinwort Benson said it planned to create a Global Derivatives Retail Business with main activities in Frankfurt, London, Paris, Zurich, Hongkong and New York.</p>
<p>It said in a statement the business would involve the structuring and distribution of global retail products including covered warrants, index certificates and capital guaranteed notes.</p>
<p>&quot;This development will be conducted under the leadership of Roselly Ramseyer-Torres, who is joining us from Bankers Trust where she spearheaded derivatives retail business,&quot; said the statement.</p>
<p>-- International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 8682</p>
</text>
